    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily review of chat conversations\n\n### How it works\nEvery day at 9:00:\n1. Leads are read from **Zoho CRM** and processed one by one.\n2. Leads with a chat session get their dialogue loaded from **Postgres** memory.\n3. The **AI reviewer** scores the conversation and saves errors and recommendations to **Google Sheets**.\n\nThe weekly report (workflow 03) uses these reviews.\n\n### Setup\n- Connect Zoho CRM, Postgres (the same memory as workflow 01), OpenAI and Google Sheets.\n- The chat session ID is stored on the lead (field used in **Has chat session?**).\n- Set the review sheet ID in **Sheets: save review**.\n\n[Prompt not published in this showcase.]",
        "height": 675,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "2c33dd19-f079-4c2a-8576-b123c0498eb7",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -626,
        -170
      ]
    }
